  "private": true,
  "description": "An eve agent in a Next.js app on Supabase: the Supabase World, Supabase sign-in on eve routes, Vault-backed MCP and OpenAPI connections, a tool that runs as the member under row-level security behind an approval, queue schedules, memory, sessions in the chat tables and the inbox as a channel.",
